    <string-array name="changelog_3_0">
        <item>Sleep timer: 15 to 90 minutes or at the end of the track, fading the volume out</item>
        <item>Home-screen widget with cover, controls and spinning reels</item>
        <item>Android Auto: browse playlists, albums, artists and folders; controls on your watch (Wear OS)</item>
        <item>Browse the library by folder</item>
        <item>Smart playlists: Most played and Haven\'t heard in a while</item>
        <item>Resume when wired or Bluetooth headphones connect</item>
        <item>Smooth fades between tracks and gapless playback</item>
        <item>Even volume with ReplayGain (per track or per album)</item>
        <item>Adjustable speed (0.5× to 2×) and pitch in the player</item>
        <item>Cassette types (Normal, Chrome, Metal), label color and a handwritten name</item>
        <item>Side A / Side B: the queue becomes a two-sided tape that flips with an animation</item>
        <item>Tape effects: hiss, wow &amp; flutter and the clack of the keys</item>
        <item>Share mixtape: an image of the tape with the track list</item>
        <item>Player background in the cover\'s colors</item>
        <item>Listening stats with a monthly recap</item>
        <item>Last.fm scrobbling via Pano Scrobbler or Simple Last.fm Scrobbler</item>
        <item>Search inside song lyrics</item>
    </string-array>
</resources>
